_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339655978","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110935#issuecomment-3339655978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110935","id":3339655978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HDxsq","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T17:00:41Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T17:01:12Z","body":"This begs the question of whether we should implicitly add a trailing underscore to the second parameter of `@export_subgroup()` if there is none. However, this would break use cases where variables with a different naming convention than snake_case is used, so it's probably not a good idea.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339655978/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341357945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110935#issuecomment-3341357945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110935","id":3341357945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HKRN5","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T07:45:10Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T07:45:10Z","body":"I agree that changing the behavior of this annotation and/or property hint is a bad idea. Everything works correctly now, removing the exact prefix you specified.\n\nHowever, perhaps we could address this edge case in the Inspector UI? By default, the option to capitalize property names in the Inspector is enabled, and this also removes the leading underscore from \"private\" GDScript properties (for example, `@export var _my_property: int` is displayed as `My Property`). We need to figure out why it behaves differently when removing the prefix in subgroups.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341357945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3347744885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110935#issuecomment-3347744885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110935","id":3347744885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hioh1","user":{"login":"mieldepoche","id":71937306,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTM3MzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71937306?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche","html_url":"https://github.com/mieldepoche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mieldepoche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T15:45:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T15:45:11Z","body":"I just realized, my editor is set up so that names show up in raw form (`var _value` will show in the inspector as `_value`).\n\n> I think u wrote it wrong\n\nIndeed, all this stems from me not realizing I should add the `_` to the stripped prefix.\n\nSo the actual problem I assume, is that the subgroup is misconfigured for `one_way_collision_margin` specifically, by someone who made the same assumption as I did about how groups should be named.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3347744885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]